---
// 分页控件：页码 + 下一页。URL 生成交给 utils/pagination，页面只传当前页与总页数。
import { blogPageUrl } from '../utils/pagination';

interface Props {
  currentPage: number;
  totalPages: number;
}

const { currentPage, totalPages } = Astro.props;
const pageNumbers = Array.from({ length: totalPages }, (_, i) => i + 1);
const hasNext = currentPage < totalPages;
---

{
  totalPages > 1 && (
    <nav class="pagination" aria-label="文章分页">
      <div class="page-numbers">
        {pageNumbers.map((p) => (
          <a
            href={blogPageUrl(p)}
            class:list={['page-link', p === currentPage && 'active']}
            aria-label={p === currentPage ? '当前页' : `第 ${p} 页`}
            aria-current={p === currentPage ? 'page' : undefined}
          >
            {p}
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      {hasNext && (
        <a href={blogPageUrl(currentPage + 1)} class="page-btn next">
          下一页 →
        </a>
      )}
    </nav>
  )
}
